  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Ka2hKB.png\" alt=\"YUNG's Better Dungeons\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"需要 YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 YUNG GANG 的 Discord！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上追蹤我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"訂閱我的 YouTube！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上贊助我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gf4exw0.png\" alt=\"這是什麼？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;這是一個前所未有的 Minecraft 地牢完全重設計畫。YUNG's Better Dungeons 重新設計了原版地牢，同時新增了三個全新地牢：<strong>地下墓穴、不死者要塞與蜘蛛洞穴！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.19.2 帶來了下界更新！&nbsp;</strong>現在你可以在下界各處發現小型的下界地牢。<strong>請注意這屬於額外可選功能</strong>，意味著你必須前往模組設定檔中手動啟用它。</p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1gBQ8gCs4tU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JR6R3uf.png\" alt=\"相容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG's Better Dungeons 旨在與所有世界生成模組完全相容，包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Strongholds</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Mineshafts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Bridges</a></li>\n<li>Repurposed Structures。RS 還提供一個自訂資料包，可搭配此模組使用，為來自 Better Dungeons 的小型地牢加入重新設計的版本！<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-better-dungeons-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此前往查看。</a>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每個獨立的地牢皆可透過設定檔或資料包進行調整。你也可以利用資料包啟用原版地牢，使其與 Better Dungeons 一同生成。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"使用優惠碼 YUNGNICKYOUNG 於 Bisect Hosting 購買可享 25% 折扣！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
